  "visual_review": "The shoe close-ups show a continuous molded foxing edge, shallow sole groove and reinforced heel canvas. Front and profile head views now show a short cropped hair surface on the anatomical scalp; the rear view preserves the original silhouette.",
  "body_detail_review": "Seventy-two thousand tapered native hair fibers use a position-dependent hairline and three restrained brown tones. The shoe details follow the posed outsole control mesh. A separate shorts-slimming study was rejected after the nearest exposed-thigh clearance became negative; no shorts geometry from that study was promoted. Native geometry and cold checks establish placement, not photographic realism.",
  "remaining": "The human-realism goal remains unfinished. The face and expression remain generic, shorts require a collision-aware pattern and drape revision, and the walking pose and whole-body reference match still need work. Architectural, retail and planting realism follow human acceptance. This is offline Blender art, not runtime integration.",
